<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Company Landing Page</title>
    
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fontsource/tasa-explorer@5.0.8/index.css">

    <style>
        /* --- Reset & Global Styles --- */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'TASA Explorer', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #040914;
            color: #ffffff;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* --- Header & Navigation --- */
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            z-index: 100;
            background: transparent;
            padding: 30px 80px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: row;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }

        .logo {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        /* Graphic Logo Icon Styling */
        .logo-graphic {
            width: 38px;
            height: 38px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF5C1A, #8DD8DE);
            clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 25%, 100% 75%, 50% 100%, 0% 75%, 0% 25%);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255, 92, 26, 0.4);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        /* Navigation - Aligned to the Right */
        nav {
            margin-left: auto;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: row;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 40px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        nav ul li a {
            color: #c1ebef;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            transition: color 0.3s ease, opacity 0.3s ease;
            opacity: 0.85;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        nav ul li a:hover {
            color: #ffffff;
            opacity: 1;
        }

        /* --- Hero Section --- */
        .hero {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100vh;
            min-height: 650px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 10%;
            background-color: #040914;
            background-image: url('Untitled-1.jpg');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center bottom;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 820px;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .hero-tagline {
            color: #8DD8DE;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: inline-block;
            border-left: 2px solid #FF5C1A;
            padding-left: 12px;
        }

        /* --- Hero Slogan Special Text Effects --- */
        .hero-title {
            font-size: 64px;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.1;
            color: #ffffff;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .hero-title span {
            display: block;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8DD8DE 0%, #c1ebef 50%, #FF5C1A 100%);
            background-size: 200% auto;
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            text-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(141, 216, 222, 0.35);
            animation: shimmerGradient 8s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes shimmerGradient {
            0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
            50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
            100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
        }

        /* Subtle scroll prompt indicator */
        .scroll-indicator {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 40px;
            left: 10%;
            color: #8DD8DE;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        /* --- Content Sections (Fit on Single Screen) --- */
        .section-content {
            min-height: 100vh;
            background-color: #040914;
            background-image: none; 
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            padding: 100px 8% 60px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 32px;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 700;
            max-width: 800px;
            line-height: 1.25;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        /* Fixed 3-Column Horizontal Grid */
        .section-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 24px;
            margin-top: 40px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        /* Compact Apple Glassmorphism Style */
        .content-card {
            background: rgba(11, 33, 69, 0.3);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(193, 235, 239, 0.15);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(4, 9, 20, 0.5);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 14px;
            transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), border-color 0.3s ease, background-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .content-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            background: rgba(18, 40, 96, 0.45);
            border-color: rgba(141, 216, 222, 0.4);
        }

        /* Scaled-down Graphic Placeholder */
        .card-graphic-placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 120px;
            background: rgba(4, 9, 20, 0.4);
            border: 1px dashed rgba(141, 216, 222, 0.25);
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .card-graphic-placeholder::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border: 2px solid rgba(141, 216, 222, 0.1);
            transform: rotate(45deg);
        }

        .card-text-content {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .content-card h3 {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .content-card p {
            color: #c1ebef;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            opacity: 0.85;
        }

        /* --- Responsive Design --- */
        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            header {
                padding: 20px 24px;
            }

            nav ul {
                gap: 16px;
            }

            nav ul li a {
                font-size: 13px;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 140px 6% 60px;
                text-align: center;
                justify-content: center;
            }

            .hero-title {
                font-size: 38px;
            }

            .hero-tagline {
                border-left: none;
                padding-left: 0;
            }

            .scroll-indicator {
                left: 50%;
                transform: translateX(-50%);
            }

            .section-content {
                padding: 100px 6% 60px;
                min-height: auto;
            }

            .section-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .card-graphic-placeholder {
                height: 160px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 650px) {
            header {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 16px;
            }

            nav {
                margin-left: 0;
            }

            nav ul {
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                justify-content: center;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <a href="#home" class="logo">
            <div class="logo-graphic"></div>
        </a>
        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a></li>
                <li><a href="#about">About us</a></li>
                <li><a href="#careers">Careers</a></li>
                <li><a href="#newsroom">Newsroom</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- Landing Hero -->
    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <p class="hero-tagline">XPlora</p>
            <h1 class="hero-title">MOVING HEAT <span>BEYOND BOUNDARIES</span></h1>
        </div>
        <div class="scroll-indicator">Scroll to explore &darr;</div>
    </section>

    <!-- Content visible on scroll (Full viewport height, horizontal layout) -->
    <section class="section-content" id="how-it-works">
        <h2 class="section-title">We Exist to Make Energy Storage Revolutionary and Impactful.</h2>
        <div class="section-grid">
            
            <!-- Card 01 -->
            <div class="content-card">
                <div class="card-graphic-placeholder"></div>
                <div class="card-text-content">
                    <h3>01. Break Barriers in Heat Storage</h3>
                    <p>Store energy effectively across time and place.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 02 -->
            <div class="content-card">
                <div class="card-graphic-placeholder"></div>
                <div class="card-text-content">
                    <h3>02. Thermodynamic Transfer</h3>
                    <p>Proprietary heat exchangers designed for maximum efficiency across severe operating conditions.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 03 -->
            <div class="content-card">
                <div class="card-graphic-placeholder"></div>
                <div class="card-text-content">
                    <h3>03. System Integration</h3>
                    <p>Seamlessly feed captured energy back into facility grids to reduce reliance on external power.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

</body>
</html>